{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.2022b.q28.material.recovered", "text": "材料：【试题】艾滋病是影响人类健康的传染病，科学家和社会对此高度关注，开展了大量的研究，试图在艾滋病的治疗方面有所突破。（1）下列有关艾滋病的说法正确的是（ ）。A.HIV病毒自身无完整酶系B.HIV病毒具有染色体，遗传物质是RNAC.HIV病毒只会侵染人体中的辅助性T淋巴细胞D.父母患艾滋病，其子女也会患病（2）根据研究的数据（原始数据表格略），画出感染HIV病毒后，人体内HIV病毒的浓度和T细胞数量的变化曲线图。（3）某研究团队宣布全球首例艾滋病的基因编辑婴儿双胞胎诞生，并称这对双胞胎的一个基因经过修改，他们出生后即可天然抵抗艾滋病。该消息一经报道，立即遭到了社会各界的强烈反对。试分析社会各界强烈反对基因编辑婴儿事件的原因。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "87ba14aa7091bf6e177342049d257e7463401c4a4f829c56069bd715add3df23", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2277, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2595, "next_source_question_number": 28, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 28, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "87ba14aa7091bf6e177342049d257e7463401c4a4f829c56069bd715add3df23"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.2022b.q28"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.s1.k01", "ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.s1.k04", "ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.s2.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.408.r001", "ntce.outline.408.r003", "ntce.outline.408.r012"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.2022b.q28"], "word_count": 318, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "shengwu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "87ba14aa7091bf6e177342049d257e7463401c4a4f829c56069bd715add3df23", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2277, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2595, "next_source_question_number": 28, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_wit